get.description:
Assessor Maps API V2 provides direct access to retrieve Assessor Parcel Map images for a variety of property-related document types. The Assessor Parcel Map images are recorded at the county-level and include real property records, also known as 'official records'.

To search for Assessor Parcel Maps, the following minimum search criteria must be specified:

{Fips Code}

{APN}

Comparables API provides comparable data on recently sold properties that are in proximity to the subject property (CLIP).  
Additional filters that can be applied include Number of Bedrooms/Bathrooms; Property Square Footage; 
Number of Properties returned and other filters.
